{"seq":3,"slug":"troubleshooting-patterns","title":"基于追踪的故障排查模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/operations/troubleshooting-patterns","wordCount":1337,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于追踪的故障排查模式\">基于追踪的故障排查模式</h1><p>分布式追踪的终极价值在于加速故障定位——将 MTTR（平均修复时间）从小时级压缩到分钟级。但原始追踪数据本身不等于答案，工程师需要掌握系统化的排查模式，才能从海量 Span 中快速锁定根因。本文总结六种经过生产验证的故障排查模式，配合 TraceQL 查询和可视化工具的具体用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>基于追踪的故障排查本质上是一个&quot;假设-验证&quot;循环：从告警/症状出发形成初始假设，通过追踪数据验证或否定假设，逐步缩小范围直到锁定根因。追踪数据的独特价值在于它保留了因果关系（谁调了谁）和时序关系（先后顺序），这是日志和指标无法提供的维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排查工作流总览\">排查工作流总览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    ALERT[&quot;告警触发&lt;br/&gt;或用户报障&quot;] --&gt; SCOPE[&quot;圈定范围&lt;br/&gt;时间窗 + 影响服务&quot;]&#10;    SCOPE --&gt; SAMPLE[&quot;找到代表性 Trace&lt;br/&gt;错误/慢请求&quot;]&#10;    SAMPLE --&gt; ANALYZE[&quot;分析 Trace&lt;br/&gt;瀑布图 + 关键路径&quot;]&#10;    ANALYZE --&gt; ROOT[&quot;定位根因&lt;br/&gt;具体 Span + 上下文&quot;]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; CORRELATE[&quot;关联验证&lt;br/&gt;Logs + Metrics + Profiles&quot;]&#10;    CORRELATE --&gt; FIX[&quot;修复 + 验证&lt;br/&gt;确认链路恢复&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    ALERT[\"告警触发&lt;br/&gt;或用户报障\"] --&gt; SCOPE[\"圈定范围&lt;br/&gt;时间窗 + 影响服务\"]\n    SCOPE --&gt; SAMPLE[\"找到代表性 Trace&lt;br/&gt;错误/慢请求\"]\n    SAMPLE --&gt; ANALYZE[\"分析 Trace&lt;br/&gt;瀑布图 + 关键路径\"]\n    ANALYZE --&gt; ROOT[\"定位根因&lt;br/&gt;具体 Span + 上下文\"]\n    ROOT --&gt; CORRELATE[\"关联验证&lt;br/&gt;Logs + Metrics + Profiles\"]\n    CORRELATE --&gt; FIX[\"修复 + 验证&lt;br/&gt;确认链路恢复\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>关键动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>圈定范围</td>\n<td>服务拓扑图 + 仪表盘</td>\n<td>确认哪些服务/端点受影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>找代表性 Trace</td>\n<td>TraceQL 查询</td>\n<td>按错误/延迟筛选典型案例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析 Trace</td>\n<td>瀑布图 + 关键路径</td>\n<td>找到耗时最长或出错的 Span</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定位根因</td>\n<td>Span Attributes + Events</td>\n<td>读取错误信息、SQL、超时细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联验证</td>\n<td>Grafana Explore (Trace→Log→Metric)</td>\n<td>交叉确认假设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修复验证</td>\n<td>实时 Trace 对比</td>\n<td>确认修复后链路恢复正常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模式一-延迟突增定位\">模式一：延迟突增定位</h2><h3 id=\"症状\">症状</h3><p>服务 P99 延迟从 200ms 突增到 2000ms，影响用户体验。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排查步骤\">排查步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// Step 1: 找到慢请求的 Trace&#10;{ resource.service.name = &quot;order-service&quot; &amp;&amp; duration &gt; 1.5s }&#10;  with(most_recent=true)&#10;&#10;// Step 2: 对比正常和异常 Trace 的延迟分布&#10;{ resource.service.name = &quot;order-service&quot; }&#10;  | quantile_over_time(duration, 0.99) by (span.http.route)&#10;  &gt; 1s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Step 1: 找到慢请求的 Trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ resource.service.name = \"order-service\" &#x26;&#x26; duration > 1.5s }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  with(most_recent=true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Step 2: 对比正常和异常 Trace 的延迟分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ resource.service.name = \"order-service\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | quantile_over_time(duration, 0.99) by (span.http.route)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  > 1s</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"瀑布图分析要点\">瀑布图分析要点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型根因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单个子 Span 极慢</td>\n<td>下游服务/DB 问题</td>\n<td>慢查询、连接池满</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多个并行 Span 同时变慢</td>\n<td>共享资源竞争</td>\n<td>CPU 打满、GC 风暴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Span 之间大段空白</td>\n<td>等待/排队</td>\n<td>线程池满、连接等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整棵树均匀变慢</td>\n<td>网络层问题</td>\n<td>跨 AZ 延迟、DNS 抖动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模式二-错误链路追溯\">模式二：错误链路追溯</h2><h3 id=\"症状\">症状</h3><p>错误率突然上升，需要定位错误的发源点和传播路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排查步骤\">排查步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// Step 1: 找到错误 Trace，定位最深的错误 Span&#10;{ status = error }&#10;  &gt;&gt; { status = error &amp;&amp; span.db.system != &quot;&quot; }&#10;&#10;// Step 2: 按错误类型分组统计&#10;{ status = error }&#10;  | rate() by (span.exception.type)&#10;&#10;// Step 3: 找到错误的根源 Span（没有错误子 Span 的错误 Span）&#10;{ status = error &amp;&amp; kind = server }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Step 1: 找到错误 Trace，定位最深的错误 Span</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ status = error }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  >> { status = error &#x26;&#x26; span.db.system != \"\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Step 2: 按错误类型分组统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ status = error }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | rate() by (span.exception.type)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Step 3: 找到错误的根源 Span（没有错误子 Span 的错误 Span）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ status = error &#x26;&#x26; kind = server }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"错误传播模型\">错误传播模型</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    GW[&quot;Gateway&lt;br/&gt;status=error&lt;br/&gt;(传播)&quot;]&#10;    ORDER[&quot;Order Service&lt;br/&gt;status=error&lt;br/&gt;(传播)&quot;]&#10;    PAY[&quot;Payment Service&lt;br/&gt;status=error&lt;br/&gt;(根源)&quot;]&#10;    BANK[&quot;Bank API&lt;br/&gt;Connection Refused&quot;]&#10;&#10;    GW --&gt; ORDER&#10;    ORDER --&gt; PAY&#10;    PAY --&gt;|&quot;调用失败&quot;| BANK\">flowchart TD\n    GW[\"Gateway&lt;br/&gt;status=error&lt;br/&gt;(传播)\"]\n    ORDER[\"Order Service&lt;br/&gt;status=error&lt;br/&gt;(传播)\"]\n    PAY[\"Payment Service&lt;br/&gt;status=error&lt;br/&gt;(根源)\"]\n    BANK[\"Bank API&lt;br/&gt;Connection Refused\"]\n\n    GW --&gt; ORDER\n    ORDER --&gt; PAY\n    PAY --&gt;|\"调用失败\"| BANK</pre><p>关键洞察：瀑布图中<strong>最深层</strong>的错误 Span 通常是根因。上层 Span 的错误是传播结果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常见错误模式与根因\">常见错误模式与根因</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误 Pattern</th>\n<th>可能根因</th>\n<th>验证方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单个下游 5xx</td>\n<td>下游服务 bug 或资源不足</td>\n<td>查看下游的 error Event 和 Attributes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间歇性超时</td>\n<td>网络抖动或 GC 停顿</td>\n<td>关联 infra metrics (CPU/GC pause)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量 connection refused</td>\n<td>下游重启或端口占满</td>\n<td>查 Pod events 和 connection pool metrics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化/解析错误</td>\n<td>接口不兼容（版本 skew）</td>\n<td>对比请求/响应 schema</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模式三-级联故障分析\">模式三：级联故障分析</h2><h3 id=\"症状\">症状</h3><p>一个服务故障导致多个上游服务受影响，形成雪崩。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排查步骤\">排查步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 找到扇出调用中的超时模式&#10;{ kind = client &amp;&amp; status = error }&#10;  | rate() by (resource.service.name, span.server.address)&#10;&#10;// 在服务拓扑图上追踪故障传播路径&#10;{ resource.service.name = &quot;inventory-service&quot; &amp;&amp; status = error }&#10;  &amp;&amp; { resource.service.name = &quot;order-service&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 找到扇出调用中的超时模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ kind = client &#x26;&#x26; status = error }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | rate() by (resource.service.name, span.server.address)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在服务拓扑图上追踪故障传播路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ resource.service.name = \"inventory-service\" &#x26;&#x26; status = error }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x26;&#x26; { resource.service.name = \"order-service\" }</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Cascade[&quot;级联故障时间线&quot;]&#10;        T1[&quot;T+0s: DB 连接池满&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;T+5s: Inventory Service&lt;br/&gt;响应超时&quot;]&#10;        T3[&quot;T+10s: Order Service&lt;br/&gt;重试风暴&quot;]&#10;        T4[&quot;T+15s: Gateway&lt;br/&gt;队列积压&quot;]&#10;        T5[&quot;T+20s: 全局 503&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    T1 --&gt; T2 --&gt; T3 --&gt; T4 --&gt; T5\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Cascade[\"级联故障时间线\"]\n        T1[\"T+0s: DB 连接池满\"]\n        T2[\"T+5s: Inventory Service&lt;br/&gt;响应超时\"]\n        T3[\"T+10s: Order Service&lt;br/&gt;重试风暴\"]\n        T4[\"T+15s: Gateway&lt;br/&gt;队列积压\"]\n        T5[\"T+20s: 全局 503\"]\n    end\n    T1 --&gt; T2 --&gt; T3 --&gt; T4 --&gt; T5</pre><h3 id=\"分析要点\">分析要点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>正常值</th>\n<th>故障时</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>请求深度 (Span 层数)</td>\n<td>4-6</td>\n<td>10+</td>\n<td>重试导致链路加深</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发 Span 数</td>\n<td>2-3</td>\n<td>20+</td>\n<td>超时未释放 + 新请求堆积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trace 总时长</td>\n<td>&lt; 1s</td>\n<td>30s+</td>\n<td>超时堆叠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模式四-性能回归比对\">模式四：性能回归比对</h2><h3 id=\"症状\">症状</h3><p>新版本部署后延迟上升，需要确认是代码变更还是环境因素。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排查步骤\">排查步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 对比新旧版本的延迟分布&#10;// 旧版本 (通过 service.version 区分)&#10;{ resource.service.name = &quot;payment&quot;&#10;  &amp;&amp; resource.service.version = &quot;2.3.0&quot; }&#10;  | avg_over_time(duration) by (span.http.route)&#10;&#10;// 新版本&#10;{ resource.service.name = &quot;payment&quot;&#10;  &amp;&amp; resource.service.version = &quot;2.4.0&quot; }&#10;  | avg_over_time(duration) by (span.http.route)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 对比新旧版本的延迟分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 旧版本 (通过 service.version 区分)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ resource.service.name = \"payment\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x26;&#x26; resource.service.version = \"2.3.0\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | avg_over_time(duration) by (span.http.route)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 新版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ resource.service.name = \"payment\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x26;&#x26; resource.service.version = \"2.4.0\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | avg_over_time(duration) by (span.http.route)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>查询方式</th>\n<th>分析价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>端点延迟</td>\n<td><code>avg_over_time(duration) by (span.http.route)</code></td>\n<td>定位变慢的具体 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子调用模式</td>\n<td>瀑布图结构对比</td>\n<td>新版本是否增加了调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库查询</td>\n<td><code>{ span.db.system != &quot;&quot; } | avg(duration)</code></td>\n<td>SQL 是否退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部依赖</td>\n<td><code>{ kind = client } | rate() by (span.server.address)</code></td>\n<td>是否调用了新依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模式五-分布式死锁检测\">模式五：分布式死锁检测</h2><h3 id=\"症状\">症状</h3><p>请求持续超时但无明显错误，系统看起来&quot;卡住了&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排查步骤\">排查步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 找到极长但无错误的 Trace&#10;{ traceDuration &gt; 30s &amp;&amp; status != error }&#10;&#10;// 找到父 Span 还在进行中但子 Span 已结束的模式&#10;{ duration &gt; 30s &amp;&amp; kind = server }&#10;  &gt; { duration &lt; 1s }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 找到极长但无错误的 Trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ traceDuration > 30s &#x26;&#x26; status != error }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 找到父 Span 还在进行中但子 Span 已结束的模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ duration > 30s &#x26;&#x26; kind = server }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  > { duration &#x3C; 1s }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"典型死锁模式\">典型死锁模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>Trace 表现</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连接池耗尽</td>\n<td>Span 开始后长时间无子 Span</td>\n<td>等待可用连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程池满</td>\n<td>请求 Span 创建但长时间不结束</td>\n<td>所有工作线程阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式锁等待</td>\n<td>跨服务的长等待 Span</td>\n<td>锁持有者故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环依赖超时</td>\n<td>A 等 B、B 等 C、C 等 A</td>\n<td>设计缺陷</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模式六-数据不一致追溯\">模式六：数据不一致追溯</h2><h3 id=\"症状\">症状</h3><p>业务数据出现不一致（如扣款成功但订单未创建），需要重建事件顺序。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排查步骤\">排查步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 通过业务 ID 找到相关 Trace&#10;{ span.order.id = &quot;ORD-12345&quot; }&#10;&#10;// 找到同一订单的所有操作&#10;{ span.order.id = &quot;ORD-12345&quot; }&#10;  | count() by (resource.service.name, name)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 通过业务 ID 找到相关 Trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ span.order.id = \"ORD-12345\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 找到同一订单的所有操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ span.order.id = \"ORD-12345\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | count() by (resource.service.name, name)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键能力：通过 Baggage 或 Span Attributes 中的业务标识（order_id, user_id）将跨 Trace 的操作串联起来，重建完整的业务时间线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排查效率度量\">排查效率度量</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>衡量方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定位到根因的时间</td>\n<td>&lt; 15 分钟</td>\n<td>从告警到确认根因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要查看的 Trace 数</td>\n<td>&lt; 5 条</td>\n<td>TraceQL 精确筛选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨工具切换次数</td>\n<td>&lt; 3 次</td>\n<td>Grafana 三信号联动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误判率</td>\n<td>&lt; 10%</td>\n<td>根因确认 vs 初始假设</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>延迟排查关注瀑布图中的长条和空白间隙，对照四种模式分类</li>\n<li>错误排查从最深层错误 Span 入手，向上追溯传播路径</li>\n<li>级联故障通过重试深度和并发堆积识别，关注超时链式放大</li>\n<li>性能回归通过版本对比 + 端点粒度分析快速定位退化点</li>\n<li>TraceQL 的结构化查询（<code>&gt;&gt;</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&amp;&amp;</code>）让复杂场景的排查变得声明式</li>\n<li>建立业务标识到 Trace 的映射是数据一致性问题排查的前提</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"performance-optimization\">性能优化与成本控制</a>：如何确保排查时有足够的追踪数据可用</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../service-mesh/traffic-management/resilience-patterns\">服务网格弹性模式</a>：重试/熔断/超时如何在追踪中体现</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基于追踪的故障排查模式","id":"基于追踪的故障排查模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"排查工作流总览","id":"排查工作流总览"},{"level":2,"text":"模式一：延迟突增定位","id":"模式一-延迟突增定位"},{"level":3,"text":"症状","id":"症状"},{"level":3,"text":"排查步骤","id":"排查步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"瀑布图分析要点","id":"瀑布图分析要点"},{"level":2,"text":"模式二：错误链路追溯","id":"模式二-错误链路追溯"},{"level":3,"text":"症状","id":"症状"},{"level":3,"text":"排查步骤","id":"排查步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"错误传播模型","id":"错误传播模型"},{"level":3,"text":"常见错误模式与根因","id":"常见错误模式与根因"},{"level":2,"text":"模式三：级联故障分析","id":"模式三-级联故障分析"},{"level":3,"text":"症状","id":"症状"},{"level":3,"text":"排查步骤","id":"排查步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"分析要点","id":"分析要点"},{"level":2,"text":"模式四：性能回归比对","id":"模式四-性能回归比对"},{"level":3,"text":"症状","id":"症状"},{"level":3,"text":"排查步骤","id":"排查步骤"},{"level":2,"text":"模式五：分布式死锁检测","id":"模式五-分布式死锁检测"},{"level":3,"text":"症状","id":"症状"},{"level":3,"text":"排查步骤","id":"排查步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"典型死锁模式","id":"典型死锁模式"},{"level":2,"text":"模式六：数据不一致追溯","id":"模式六-数据不一致追溯"},{"level":3,"text":"症状","id":"症状"},{"level":3,"text":"排查步骤","id":"排查步骤"},{"level":2,"text":"排查效率度量","id":"排查效率度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"性能优化与成本控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/operations/performance-optimization"},"next":null}